(c) call_stack_depth < 1024 (else abort). If either of the aborting conditions hold then abort_condition==1 else abort_condition==0.
(c) call_stack_depth <= 1023 csox = out_of_bounds_check(0, DATA_6, 0, 0, 1023)
(c) call_stack_depth < 1024 else abort); (d) creator nonce < EIP2681_MAX_NONCE (else abort) e) the createe has non-zero nonce (else fail); (f) the createe has empty bytecode (else fail).
(c) call_stack_depth < 1024 csox = out_of_bounds_check(0, DATA_6, 0, 1, 1024) d) creater_nonce < EIP2681_MAX_NONCE nox = out_of_bounds_check(0, DATA_9, 0, 1, EIP2681_MAX_NONCE) </text>

