FileCopyrightText: <text> (c) recursive verification of the N l2-execution proofs whose ranges tile the conflations' combined block range. The rollup proof is the smallest unit of aggregation: it folds multiple l2-execution proofs into one and exposes the unified 20-field public-input tuple. </text>

